    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emberfall</strong> is the first Roguevania-Survivor: an action-platformer blending roguelite, Metroidvania, and survivor elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the treacherous catacombs of the fallen citadel 'Lemia,' brimming with danger and mystery, and escape within 10 minutes\u2014or face eternal doom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emberfall puts you in control of Kali, who defeated the God of Greed and the Goddess of Light. Now, the gods have failed, and the citadel will collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tough and fast, with snappy controls and endless challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301890/extras/19639874b637bebadd7097828ccab903.poster.avif?t=1749048123\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301890/extras/19639874b637bebadd7097828ccab903.webm?t=1749048123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301890/extras/19639874b637bebadd7097828ccab903.mp4?t=1749048123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an idling-combat system and focus on finding your way out while dodging enemies and sharpening your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must unlock certain skills to progress. Like a Metroidvania but without complexe progression and worldmap. Just enjoy short runs: <strong>Play, Die, Learn, Repeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301890/extras/0b18b2baabd5e923cda0ad41ab6931f9.avif?t=1749048123\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a simple <strong>Roguelite system</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase upgrades across your runs to become more powerful for the next runs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301890/extras/1082eeefc63bbc8f19a7e0a1d3f5a360.avif?t=1749048123\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Starting Tips from the dev:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience points are collected automatically, so don\u2019t be afraid to run away from monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your attack gauge and aim for packs of monsters; your attacks are all area-effective.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the beginning, increase your attack speed or unlock new offensive spells rather than focusing on damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spending your money in the shop will help with early game in future runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A game made by and improved with community's help</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your thoughts, ideas, improvements and feedback with me so I can improve the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The community is welcoming anyone on Steam Hub or Discord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having a bad experience or facing a bug? Let me know this with a post (even negative) rather than posting a negative review, so I can make the game better!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emberfall</strong> is the first Roguevania-Survivor: an action-platformer blending roguelite, Metroidvania, and survivor elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the treacherous catacombs of the fallen citadel 'Lemia,' brimming with danger and mystery, and escape within 10 minutes\u2014or face eternal doom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emberfall puts you in control of Kali, who defeated the God of Greed and the Goddess of Light. Now, the gods have failed, and the citadel will collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tough and fast, with snappy controls and endless challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301890/extras/19639874b637bebadd7097828ccab903.poster.avif?t=1749048123\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301890/extras/19639874b637bebadd7097828ccab903.webm?t=1749048123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301890/extras/19639874b637bebadd7097828ccab903.mp4?t=1749048123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an idling-combat system and focus on finding your way out while dodging enemies and sharpening your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must unlock certain skills to progress. Like a Metroidvania but without complexe progression and worldmap. Just enjoy short runs: <strong>Play, Die, Learn, Repeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301890/extras/0b18b2baabd5e923cda0ad41ab6931f9.avif?t=1749048123\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a simple <strong>Roguelite system</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase upgrades across your runs to become more powerful for the next runs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301890/extras/1082eeefc63bbc8f19a7e0a1d3f5a360.avif?t=1749048123\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Starting Tips from the dev:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience points are collected automatically, so don\u2019t be afraid to run away from monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your attack gauge and aim for packs of monsters; your attacks are all area-effective.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the beginning, increase your attack speed or unlock new offensive spells rather than focusing on damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spending your money in the shop will help with early game in future runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A game made by and improved with community's help</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your thoughts, ideas, improvements and feedback with me so I can improve the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The community is welcoming anyone on Steam Hub or Discord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having a bad experience or facing a bug? Let me know this with a post (even negative) rather than posting a negative review, so I can make the game better!</p>",
    "short_description": "Emberfall is the first Roguevania-Survivor: an action-platformer blending roguelite, Metroidvania, and survivor elements. Navigate the treacherous catacombs of the fallen citadel 'Lemia,' brimming with danger and mystery, and escape within 10 minutes\u2014or face eternal doom.",
